      "startLine": 48,
      "endLine": 73,
      "signature": "Overview",
      "description": "Overview of effect, live, layer, prop, and flakyTest members",
      "whenToUse": "No detector replacement: use the feature table to choose among effect, live, layer, prop, and flakyTest before reading their pinned details.",
      "whenNotToUse": "Do not treat the table as a complete account of layer clocks, memo maps, hook timeouts, or synchronous Schema limitations.",
      "replaces": [],
      "example": "import { it } from \"@effect/vitest\"\nconst methods = [it.effect, it.live, it.layer, it.prop, it.flakyTest]\nvoid methods",
      "gotchas": [
        "Tuple and record inputs accept Schema or effect/unstable/arbitrary/Arbitrary values; fast-check Arbitraries are not this native type.",
        "Returning false, throwing, typed Effect failure or a defect falsifies and shrinks; interruption remains interruption. Normal non-false completion, including void, passes.",
        "Vitest timeout cancels generation, evaluation and shrinking through TestContext.signal; synchronous non-returning JavaScript cannot be preempted.",
        "The old fastCheck parameters and global fast-check run floor are not consumed. Root must establish native arbitrary.runs/seed policy explicitly.",
        "Callbacks receive generated values and Vitest TestContext; effect/live callbacks must return Effect; synchronous prop must not return an Effect or Promise."
      ]
    },
